          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukasumi ako, omu Isirairi yoona, hakaba hatarumu muntu noomu owakaba asemiire nk'Abusalomu; okuruga omu mara g'okuguru kwe okuhika ha kasoke eruguru, akaba ataina ekyarukugambwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obuyamwaga isoke rye (eri yamwaga buli mwaka niguhwaho, limazire kukura muno limuhinguraine), yalirengamuga obulemeezi oburukukira ha kiloguraamu emu n'ekicweka, noolengesa amabaale aganyakulenga ebintu by'omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abusalomu akazaara abaana aboojo basatu, n'omwisiki omu, ibara lye nuwe Tamara; akaba ali mukazi asemiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abusalomu nukwo yamaliire kimu ati Yerusaalemu emyaka ebiri, atakaijaga omumaiso g'omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma nubwo yatumireho Yowabbu amutume hali omukama; baitu Yowabbu yalema kwija. Yamutumaho obwakabiri, nabwo tiyaija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo yagambiire abaheereza be ati: “Omusiri ogunyakuherraine n'ogwange ogu, gwa Yowabbu, akabyaramu Sayiri; mugende mugucumike omurro.” Abaheereza ba Abusalomu baacumika omusiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Yowabbu yaimukire yataahirra Abusalomu omuka ye, yamukaguza ati: “Omusiri gwange, abaheereza bawe bagwokiize ki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abusalomu yamugarukamu ati: “Nkakutumaho ninkweta nti: ‘Oije nkutume hali omukama, omukaguze oti: Gesura nkaihwayo ki? Haakire kakuba naikaireyo.’ Leero nu hati, ka ngende omumaiso g'omukama; obundiba nacwire omusango, anyite.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Yowabbu yagenzire mw'omukama, yamugambira omutabani Abusalomu ebi yagambire. Nubwo omukama yatumire beete Abusalomu. Abusalomu yagenda mw'omukama, yajuumara haitaka omumaiso ge; omukama yamwimukya, yamugwa omukifuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
